WEBVTT

00:12:59.412 --> 00:13:01.030
and I came across this book.

00:13:01.054 --> 00:13:02.650
It was called "Do What You Are."

00:13:02.674 --> 00:13:06.687
And it was a book that helped you
figure out what your personality type was

00:13:06.711 --> 00:13:09.978
and then what your career
should be based on that type.

00:13:10.002 --> 00:13:13.880
And so I did this test,
and it was so clear, you know.

00:13:13.904 --> 00:13:16.036
All the careers for my type were, like,

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:21.029
writer, psychologist, clergy
person, social worker...

00:13:21.053 --> 00:13:23.837
You know, it was this very
particular constellation

00:13:23.861 --> 00:13:26.717
that had nothing to do with corporate law.

00:13:26.741 --> 00:13:29.661
Yeah, and that was also
a kind of eureka moment.

00:13:29.685 --> 00:13:35.135
So I think that kind of
self-diagnostic exercise is helpful.